    <data name="StoryTitle" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Why Liora exists</value>
    </data>
    <data name="StoryBody1" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>For six years Elin Sandberg tracked her cycle in a spreadsheet, because every app she tried wanted an account first and shared data with advertisers. In 2023 she showed it to Priya Raman, who had spent ten years building models that run on phones.</value>
    </data>
    <data name="StoryBody2" xml:space="preserve">
        <value>Priya's first prototype ran entirely on the phone and predicted Elin's next period within a day. They founded Liora Health in 2024 with one rule: what we don't collect, we can't lose, sell or be made to hand over. The iPhone beta opened in September 2026.</value>
